  "rai:dataLimitations": "This dataset is synthetically created from the Crossdocked2020 test set split introduced by Luo et al.",
  "rai:dataBiases": "The dataset is made from crossdocked protein-ligand complexes pockets. It follows the sanitization introduced by Luo et al.",
  "rai:personalSensitiveInformation": "This dataset does not contain personal and/or sensitive information.",
  "rai:dataUseCases": "We devise a large-scale approach to selectivity assessment by leveraging the CrossDocked2020 dataset, yielding 9,900 synthetic on-/off-target protein pairs binned into difficulty categories based on structural similarity.",
  "rai:dataSocialImpact": "Positive impact: enables comprehensive evaluation of generative SBDD models to design selective small molecules. Risks: Use for clinical applications without validation. Mitigation: Clear guidelines and limitations are discussed in the paper.",
